{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the adventure of Munu as he explores the mythical islands of Vill. Encounter formidable enemies and solve strange rune puzzles on your way to becoming a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am a solo indie dev and looking for playtesters! If you play the demo please give me feedback in discord or anywhere else to help shape the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each island is unique, as it is procedurally generated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the story on harder difficulties for a challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight multiple unique enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of different weapons of the enemies you defeated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire obelisks and use them to unlock new skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Genres:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Souls-like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3rd person</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575360?t=1758908897","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575360/97023383e56c83a36c602cf6f69600324ba8e261/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758908897","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575360/700ce463c48f558dd9f69c61925c90dde70514bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758908897","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575360/700ce463c48f558dd9f69c61925c90dde70514bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=175890